tomgroup="element" id="e-1744623741881" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1744623741881" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">寝たいのに、スマホが手放せない</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1735099671650" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1735099671650" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;">そんな夜、ありませんか？</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: normal;">通知、SNS、動画…</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: normal;">現代人は知らず知らずのうちに、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">“快楽”<span style="font-weight: normal;">の中毒になっています。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-weight: normal;"><br></span></p><p><span style="font-weight: normal;">脳が快感物質ドーパミンを求めて止まらない状態──</span></p><p>それはドーパミン依存症かもしれません。</p><p><span style="font-weight: normal;"><br></span></p><p><span style="font-weight: normal;">この依存が、あなたの睡眠をむしばみ続けているのです。</span></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744363773912" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1744363773912" style="" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/88cec6ff-bf8e-43c7-af80-06249426fe57/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/SNS%E3%81%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%20_9_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1080" height="1080" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1080" natural-height="1080"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1744363931104" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1744363931104"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1744363931052" data-id="1744363931052"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1748591347621" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1748591347621" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">ドーパミン依存症とは？</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744363962689" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1744363962689" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>私たちの脳は</p><p>楽しい・嬉しい・ワクワクすることを感じたときに</p><p>「ドーパミン」という快楽物質を分泌します。</p><p><br></p><p>このドーパミンは、生きるために必要な大切な仕組み。</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744709727409" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1744709727409" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">ただ現代の生活では</strong></p><p><strong style="">この仕組みが“暴走”しやすくなっています。</strong></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744624905852" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1744624905852" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/9a3819b5-147f-440b-bb68-0280b9d2478a/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/SNS%E3%81%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%20_4_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1080" height="1080" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1080" natural-height="1080"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744613464418" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1744613464418" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>これらはすべて、脳に小さな快楽を与え続け、</p><p>“もっと”“もっと”と刺激を求める興奮状態を生み出します。</p></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1744613514543" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1744613514543"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1744363931052" data-id="1744363931052"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1748591364435" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1748591364435" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">その結果、こんな夜に..</h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744627293925" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1744627293925" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/59f7c946-94ee-4432-8a56-24216e8756d9/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/5.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1080" height="1080" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1080" natural-height="1080"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744613514500" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1744613514500" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">これは意志が弱いからではなく、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><u>脳が興奮しているから。</u></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p>脳が興奮モード＝交感神経が優位になっている状態では</p><p>自然な眠りは訪れません。</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744709785580" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1744709785580" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">そんな眠ることに悩むあなたへ</span></p><p>新しい選択肢を。</p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744699534003" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1744699534003" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/5b333abe-334a-4157-9fe8-67349a4b2c07/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/SNS%E3%81%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%20_5_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1080" height="1080" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1080" natural-height="1080"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744614082014" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1744614082014" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>刺激を絶とうと意識しても</p><p>脳はドーパミンを求めて</p><p>またスマホへと手を伸ばしてしまう。。</p><p><br></p><p>そんな習慣のループを断ち切るには</p><p>思考ではなく、</p><p><u><strong>感覚からのアプローチが有効なこともあります。</strong></u></p><p><br></p><p>たとえば、</p><p>適度な重みで体を包み込むことで、</p><p>脳は安心を感じ、興奮のスイッチを</p><p>ゆっくりと切り替えはじめるのです。</p></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1760874780777" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1760874780777" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1760874780809" data-id="1760874780809"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1760874798135" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1760874798135" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/musubi-on" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/613a6d58-fd7d-48de-9679-7bf5fd438a28/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/3.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1920" height="1080" natural-width="1920" natural-height="1080"></a></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element"